BT /F2 16 Tf 54 723 Td (Lumen LF-60 Installation Manual) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 701 Td (Document ID: prod-lf60-installation-manual | Version: 1 | Effective: 2024-10-07 | Owner: Lumen) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 688 Td (Engineering, Rotterdam | Applies to firmware: 1.8.2) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 663 Td (1. About this manual) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 641 Td (This manual describes how to install, wire, ground, bolt and commission the Lumen LF-60 optical) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628 Td (flow meter. It applies to all LF-60 meters from DN25 to DN200 with PN16 flanges. It is written) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 615 Td (for qualified mechanical and instrumentation technicians.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 593 Td (The LF-60 shares its measuring principle and much of its installation procedure with the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 580 Td (high-pressure LF-60P. Do not use the LF-60P Installation Manual for an LF-60: straight-run) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 567 Td (lengths, bolt torques and commissioning steps differ. Menu paths on the local display are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 554 Td (written with the greater-than sign between levels, for example Menu > Setup > Outputs.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 529 Td (2. Safety) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 507 Td (Installation and removal must only be carried out when the pipe section has been isolated,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 494 Td (depressurised and drained, and, where the fluid is hot, cooled to below 40 \260C. Never loosen) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 481 Td (flange bolts on a pressurised line.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 459 Td (- Follow the site permit-to-work system and lock-out/tag-out rules before starting.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 446 Td (- The meter weighs 6.2 kg at DN50 and up to 41 kg at DN200. Use lifting straps around the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 433 Td (   meter body, never around the electronics housing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 420 Td (- The LF-60 is not certified for hazardous areas.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 407 Td (- The 24 VDC supply must be a SELV/PELV source with a current limit not exceeding 2 A.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 391 Td (3. Product identification) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 369 Td (The nameplate on the measuring tube shows the order code, serial number, nominal size, pressure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 356 Td (rating and maximum fluid temperature. Order codes follow the pattern LF60-{size}-PN16. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 343 Td (serial number format is LS followed by two digits for the year and six digits, for example) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 330 Td (LS24-011583. Check that the PN16 \(16 bar\) rating is equal to or greater than the design) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 317 Td (pressure of the line and that the fluid will not exceed +80 \260C.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 292 Td (4. Unpacking and inspection) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 270 Td (Each LF-60 is shipped with protective flange covers, two M20 x 1.5 cable glands, one blanking) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 257 Td (plug, a terminal compartment key \(4 mm hex\), a quick reference card and a calibration) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 244 Td (certificate. Keep the flange covers in place until the meter is lifted into position, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 231 Td (inspect the sapphire windows through the bore before installation. Clean only with isopropyl) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 218 Td (alcohol and a lint-free cloth.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 193 Td (5. Site selection) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 171 Td (The LF-60 measures accurately only when the pipe is full and the flow profile is well) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 158 Td (developed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 136 Td (- At least 10 pipe diameters \(10D\) of straight pipe upstream of the meter.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 123 Td (- At least 5 pipe diameters \(5D\) of straight pipe downstream.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 110 Td (- Where the upstream disturbance is a control valve or two elbows in different planes,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 97 Td (   increase the upstream length to 20D.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 84 Td (- The meter must not be at the highest point of the line.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 71 Td (- Ambient temperature at the electronics must stay between -20 and +60 \260C.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 58 Td (The LF-60 housing is rated IP65. It is protected against water jets but must not be installed) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
