stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (mA.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 704 Td (11. Flange bolting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 682 Td (Tighten flange joints in a cross pattern in three passes \(30%, 60%, 100% of final torque\),) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 669 Td (followed by a circular check pass at 100%. The values apply to EN 1092-1 PN16 flanges, lightly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 656 Td (oiled bolts of property class 8.8 or A4-70 and compressed fibre gaskets. For PTFE gaskets,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 643 Td (reduce the values by 20%.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 622 Td (Meter size | Bolts | Torque) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 610 Td (DN25 | 4 x M12 | 35 N m) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 598 Td (DN40 | 4 x M16 | 50 N m) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 586 Td (DN50 | 4 x M16 | 60 N m) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 574 Td (DN65 | 8 x M16 | 55 N m) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 562 Td (DN80 | 8 x M16 | 65 N m) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 550 Td (DN100 | 8 x M16 | 70 N m) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 538 Td (DN125 | 8 x M16 | 85 N m) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 526 Td (DN150 | 8 x M20 | 120 N m) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 514 Td (DN200 | 12 x M20 | 130 N m) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 492 Td (Pressure test the line to 1.5 times the design pressure, but never above 24 bar. Use a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 479 Td (calibrated torque wrench and do not use impact tools.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 454 Td (12. Zero-point adjustment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 432 Td (A zero-point adjustment is required only if the meter shows a flow reading above 0.5 cm/s with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 419 Td (a full, completely stationary pipe. Close valves upstream and downstream, wait 5 minutes, enter) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 406 Td (the service passcode and go to Menu > Service > Calibration > Zero Adjust. The meter averages) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 393 Td (the signal for 60 seconds. Offsets larger than \2612.5 cm/s are rejected. The damping time) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 380 Td (constant defaults to 3.0 seconds and the low-flow cut-off to 0.02 m/s.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 355 Td (13. Local display and security) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 333 Td (The two-line display shows the flow rate and the forward totaliser. Configuration menus are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 320 Td (protected by a four-digit service passcode. The factory default passcode for the LF-60 is 1060.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 307 Td (Change it at commissioning under Menu > Service > Security > Change Passcode. Write protection) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 294 Td (is enforced with DIP switch S3.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 269 Td (14. Commissioning checklist and support) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 247 Td (- Order code, serial number and PN16 rating recorded) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 234 Td (- Straight run confirmed: at least 10D upstream and 5D downstream) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 221 Td (- Flow arrow in the correct direction) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 208 Td (- Bolts tightened to the section 11 values) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 195 Td (- Grounding straps or rings fitted, resistance below 1 ohm) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 182 Td (- Supply voltage between 21.6 and 26.4 VDC) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 169 Td (- 4-20 mA loop test completed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 156 Td (- Modbus communication confirmed \(address 1, 9600 baud, 8N1 by default\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 143 Td (- Service passcode changed from the default) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 130 Td (For support, raise a ticket in the Meridian Support Centre at support.meridian-instruments.com) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 117 Td (and quote the serial number and firmware version \(1.8.2 at the time of this manual\). Error) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 104 Td (codes are described in the Lumen Error Code Reference.) Tj ET
endstream
